cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use iso20022-bank-profile-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "iso20022-bank-profile-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for bank-specific ISO 20022 clearing profiles"
abstract: >-
  A fully local, closed-world Model Context Protocol server that manages,
  validates and serves bank-specific ISO 20022 clearing profiles and rule
  packs, the market-practice rules beyond structural XSD validation: four
  read-only tools to list and fetch profiles (CBPR+, SEPA Instant, FedNow,
  Generic), lint a payload against one and validate a bank-supplied rule
  pack, with premium rule-pack entitlement gating.
authors:
